abstract: >-
  Proteomics-domain DomainAdapter for the indicium ecosystem. Provides
  ProteomicsAdapter, covering protein and peptide identification,
  quantification, PTM localisation and FDR claims, with enrichment against
  UniProtKB accessions, the HUPO-PSI PSI-MOD controlled vocabulary and EDAM,
  plus PSI mzTab and mzIdentML projections into ASB claim dicts.
